WEBVTT

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.620
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.180
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed,

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.810
Do they want to protect themselves or other people. Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.770
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.430
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:19.520
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.700
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.040
Uh oh!

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.330
Are you OK?

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.740
I broke a beaker…

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:50.530
What’s the matter?

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.810
A beaker got broken.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.710
No injuries?

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:55.770
We’re fine.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:01:00.210
I’m sorry, ma’am! I accidentally bumped into her…

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:02.790
It wasn’t like that; I bumped into her.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:04.550
It’s fine.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:08.370
Katase-san and Mikage-san, please be careful from now on.

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:09.530
Yes!

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.080
Aren’t we lucky that she was a nice teacher?

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.480
I was relieved!

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.990
I haven’t seen Niiyama-sensei get mad before.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:22.180
Really, she’s so mature.

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.530
A student again?

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.180
Yes, the first grader Katase-san.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:41.840
But since she apologized so honestly, I forgave her without lecturing her.

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:46.690
Katase is a very nice girl. Serious about work, too.

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:52.180
I guess her parents are strict.

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:17.870
Yes? This is Niiyama.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:20.830
Hello? Who are you calling?

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:24.880
Hello? Hello?

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:35.920
Cicada

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:05.830
Yuurisan-Subs & マイワイフ Subs

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:05.830
http://yuurisan-subs.org
http://maiwaifufansubs.wordpress.com

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:05.830
Sub Dedicated to Enma Ai

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.330
Good morning!

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.110
Niiyama-sensei.

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:28.750
Yes?

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:36.340
I’m very sorry for being so late.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.600
I’ve brought her.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.390
Niiyama-sensei.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.730
This is the first grader Katase Ririka-kun’s grandmother.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:49.170
Nice to meet you.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:52.860
Isn’t there something else you should say?

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:57.910
Niiyama-sensei, is it true that you lectured Katase-kun yesterday?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:00.900
Me? I haven’t done-

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.330
She’s lying!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:08.350
Ririka is saying that you pushed the responsibility of a senior breaking a beaker onto her.

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.830
But…

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:15.810
Are you, as principal, ignoring such actions by your teachers?

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.340
No, I wouldn’t do such a thing.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:22.840
If such a thing were to be proven, we would punish it severely.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:27.630
“If”? It’s not “if”; it definitely happened!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:31.600
Please wait a second. I haven’t done anything to Katase-san.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:34.930
Are you still trying to fool me?

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:37.450
Please listen to my story.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:39.140
You be quiet!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:44.970
Anyway you, shouldn’t you start with apologizing?

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.250
Niiyama-sensei!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:51.940
Niiyama-sensei, as the teacher responsible.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:59.850
If I did something that was misunderstood, I would apologize…

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:04.460
That’s how you should be speaking! How rude!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.070
She finally went home!

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.390
How unfortunate!

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:27.200
Those kinds of guardians are increasing. Even if we don’t agree, we need to apologize first.

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:31.780
In the meantime, I’ll ask Katase-san what’s going on.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:36.100
I hope you don’t irritate any students.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:39.670
Be gentle, gentle.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:50.970
I am sorry. Did my grandmother come to say such a thing?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.390
Guardians often misunderstand teachers.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.290
So, don’t mind.

00:06:57.030 --> 00:07:02.600
Grandma gets really scary when she gets mad.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:06.170
Then, can you, Katase-san, speak with your grandmother?

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:09.010
Yes, I’ll try.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.480
Thank you.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.590
Does it bother you that much?

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.570
Well, a little.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:26.860
That threatening attitude wasn’t normal.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:29.380
Is that what they call a “monster parent”?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.730
That’s worse than a monster!

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.600
It’s even worse than that.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:40.710
If we were called that, humans would be done for.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:00.890
Hello?

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.740
Whom are you calling?

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:09.370
You’re quite one-sided, aren’t you?

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:12.380
I’m sorry, but is this Katase-san’s grandmother?

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:16.820
When picking up the phone, shouldn’t you first say your name?

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:21.060
And you call yourself an educator?

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.090
Katase-san, can you listen to me calmly?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.040
Say your name!

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:30.120
Shouldn’t you know that the best?

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:36.150
Do teachers now speak to their student’s parents so rudely?

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:37.970
Do you know what time it is??

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:40.190
It doesn’t matter what time it is.

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:41.710
Aren’t you a teacher?

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:46.060
All high and mighty after scarring a student…

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:49.170
How self-centered are you.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:53.900
I have never scarred your granddaughter.

00:08:54.690 --> 00:09:01.450
It seems like you want me to call the board of directors, to say that you’re innocent. I’m appalled.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:05.820
Forcing a student to do something?

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:09.630
Forcing? What are you saying?

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:13.920
Apparently it was a third-grader who broke the beaker.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.840
During exams, right?

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:20.680
To get into a good high school, so as not to scar her soul.

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:24.520
You decided to blame a junior, right?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:28.120
I know all your dirty thoughts.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:34.490
Anyway, I can’t let Ririka be in such a school with such indecent teachers.

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:38.180
I’m going to keep her home.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:41.180
Aren’t you the indecent one?

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.780
Yes, yes.

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:03.380
I’m so very sorry! Yes,

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:05.400
something like that never…

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.960
Yes, no, no.

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:07.960
Good morning!

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:10.580
Yes, even though you say the school,

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:13.560
something like this… yes?

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.590
It’s been like that for a while.

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:19.800
Yes, yes. I will properly tell the teacher. That is a given! Yes.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.430
I wonder what that is?

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:42.100
You all only think about yourselves!

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:45.640
You’re more concerned for yourselves than the students, aren’t you?

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:47.270
No, nothing like that…

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:48.240
Katase-san, please be calm!

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:49.870
I <i>am</i> calm!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:53.840
Bring out that teacher! I won’t let her avoid responsibility!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.720
Poor Niiyama-sensei.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:58.440
Maybe it’s not her that’s poor…

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.200
Please, Katase-san!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:03.470
Bring out the principal!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:03.470
Well, she is a teacher, so there’s no use…

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.130
I’ll sue the Board of Education!

