00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:12.760
Hell Correspondence

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:15.400
Hell Correspondence

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:44.780
Katase Ririka, after losing both her parents to an accident, that grandmother raised her.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:50.350
So, I knew that her grandmother was smothering her, but to that degree…

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:53.310
Is Katase-kun absent again?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:53.810
Yes,

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:59.280
as long as we don’t fire Niiyama-sensei, she said she would keep her home.

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:05.030
I did ask the elementary school Katase-kun went to in Tokyo,

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:09.340
apparently that grandmother was very dangerous.

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:14.320
She hadn’t shown herself like that to me, her advisor…

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:22.110
Maybe it’s something like compatibility that’s the difference between you and Niiyama-sensei.

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:31.880
Niiyama-sensei, that same person from the elementary school said they waited until the storm cleared.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:34.820
Maybe we should do the same?

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:36.110
That’s a good idea!

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:42.230
If this becomes too big, other students will be scarred.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:45.140
That’s something we need to prevent as teachers.

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:52.340
Sensei, we all know that you have no fault in this incident.

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:55.150
Everyone’s on your side.

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:59.340
So hang in there for a bit.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:04.420
Everyone, let’s work together to overcome this crisis!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.080
Yes, let’s do it.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.750
It’s not your fault.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:29.370
But I heard that Katase-san’s grandmother said it really was…

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.690
No one’s to blame.

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:39.290
That was just an accident. But, there are people who have to blame someone.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.860
It’s as simple as that.

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:42.100
Sensei…

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:48.050
Since when did being a teacher become this? Not able to express themselves ever,

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:55.960
having to agree even though they know it’s wrong…

00:14:56.940 --> 00:15:03.050
When I told my company friends that, they told me it was part of being in society.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:10.750
But to teach what is necessary to live, and to teach what is ideal are different.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:14.100
I thought teachers needed to live in an ideal world.

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:18.290
But I was wrong.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:22.970
Wherever you go, that’s real life; I realized that with this occurrence.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:24.950
Is that difficult?

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:30.230
Thanks for being worried about me.

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:36.030
I was suspicious that all teachers and students only cared about themselves.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:37.570
I’ve been saved.

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:44.380
I’ll go talk to Katase-san’s grandmother now. If that’s not enough…

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:50.740
Well then, see you later! Return to your class.

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:54.310
Sensei…

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.750
It’s running out!

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.720
Wind me, wind me!

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:03.890
Yes, yes.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:17.320
Teaching has become such an unfortunate job.

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:22.740
I sympathize. Bone Lady and Ichimoku-ren both have it tough!

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:27.730
That in itself is a different misfortune.

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:30.040
Wind me, wind me!

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:33.840
How many revolutions are you trying to do?

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:19.110
Grandma is a widow. Since she’s so vulnerable, she’s always imagining the worst possible scenario for herself.

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:23.880
She can’t feel comfortable without blaming someone.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.600
But Katase-san.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.540
She’s really a nice person!

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:44.080
I’m home!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:50.910
Ririka, I’ll start preparing dinner-

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:52.360
You!

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:57.660
What are you doing here? Leave! I’ll sue you for trespassing!

00:17:57.670 --> 00:18:00.680
Katase-san, please listen to me!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.050
Be quiet!

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:05.910
Ririka, are you OK?

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:06.510
Grandma!

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:11.130
What did she tell you? What is she, this person!

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:19.020
Sensei said she would say something again if I don’t make you quiet.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.330
<i>Katase-san!</i>

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.510
Get out!

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:24.690
Katase-san!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.990
Get out!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.700
Sensei! Sensei!

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:43.530
I’m sorry! If I don’t say that, I…

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:49.650
But the only one that can tell her the truth is you, her blood relative.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:50.680
But…

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:56.550
What happens to the troubled teachers because of you lying?

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:06.610
Because… you are you, and you’re an adult, so you’re fine, right?

00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:07.890
What?

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:22.800
Did you call?

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.600
Yamawaro.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:41.230
Yes, Ojou.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.000
Take this.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:20:00.360
If you really want to release your grudge,

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:03.170
just pull the red string.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.020
This conversation isn’t over.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.420
It’s OK. I know.

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:15.550
I’m going to fall to hell too, right? I heard rumors.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.990
My heart’s already sure.

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:24.230
Because I’m a teacher, I got tired of being looked down upon.

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:28.020
Are you really OK with it?

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:33.990
If everyone pressures me by saying I’m a teacher,

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:36.110
I want to do revenge as a teacher.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:43.110
Teachers should not be responsible for guardians. Students should.

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:46.370
Then do as you like.

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:53.420
Your grudge is received.

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:01.860
Sensei!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.780
Ririka?

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:49.810
Your grudge shall be released.

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:49.810
Note: Candle says, Niiyama Rima

