00:24:20.830 --> 00:24:22.600
Your name?

00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:23.720
Serizawa Yuuna.

00:24:24.130 --> 00:24:27.290
You like that teacher?

00:24:27.290 --> 00:24:28.240
I like him a lot.

00:24:28.620 --> 00:24:30.840
I want to be near him!

00:24:30.840 --> 00:24:34.140
I want him only to look at me!

00:24:34.140 --> 00:24:37.440
But she always gets in the way!

00:24:37.770 --> 00:24:39.020
How annoying!

00:24:39.020 --> 00:24:40.390
Are you jealous?

00:24:40.410 --> 00:24:43.470
She should just disappear!

00:24:43.510 --> 00:24:45.780
Oh well…

